angs under B."}, {"edge": ["D", "E"], "take": true, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "B", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "F", "G": "G"}, "note": "<code>D-E 2</code>: roots <code>D</code> and <code>E</code> differ, so <b>take</b> it. Union: E's set (size 1) hangs under D."}, {"edge": ["E", "F"], "take": true, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"], ["E", "F"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "B", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "D", "G": "G"}, "note": "<code>E-F 2</code>: roots <code>D</code> and <code>F</code> differ, so <b>take</b> it. Union: F's set (size 1) hangs under D."}, {"edge": ["F", "G"], "take": true, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"], ["E", "F"], ["F", "G"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "B", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "D", "G": "D"}, "note": "<code>F-G 3</code>: roots <code>D</code> and <code>G</code> differ, so <b>take</b> it. Union: G's set (size 1) hangs under D."}, {"edge": ["A", "B"], "take": false, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"], ["E", "F"], ["F", "G"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "B", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "D", "G": "D"}, "note": "<code>A-B 4</code>: <code>find(A)</code> and <code>find(B)</code> are both <code>B</code>. Already connected, so this road would close a cycle: <b>skip</b>."}, {"edge": ["E", "G"], "take": false, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"], ["E", "F"], ["F", "G"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "B", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "D", "G": "D"}, "note": "<code>E-G 4</code>: <code>find(E)</code> and <code>find(G)</code> are both <code>D</code>. Already connected, so this road would close a cycle: <b>skip</b>."}, {"edge": ["B", "D"], "take": true, "tree": [["B", "C"], ["A", "C"], ["D", "E"], ["E", "F"], ["F", "G"], ["B", "D"]], "parent": {"A": "B", "B": "D", "C": "B", "D": "D", "E": "D", "F": "D", "G": "D"}, "note": "<code>B-D 5</code>: roots <code>B</code> and <code>D</code> differ, so <b>take</b> it. Union: B's set (size 3) hangs under